            <listPerson>
                <person xml:id="PIU01" sex="1">
                    <persName><roleName/>Pope
    <forename>Pius VI</forename><surname/><addName>Count Giovanni Angelo Braschi</addName></persName>
                    <birth when="1717-12-27">
                        <placeName>Italy</placeName>
                    </birth>
                    <death when="1799-08-29"/>
                    <occupation>Pope</occupation>
                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>Pope from 1775 to 1799. Godwin records his death twice,
    first on 19 April 1799 and then on 19 August 1799. Both dates are wrong, but the second
    is closest - Pius VI actually died on 29 August 1799. Godwin might be adding in dates 
    of death at a later stage and confusing April with August. </p>
                    </note>
                </person>
            </listPerson>
